<title>USA: Toyota February US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Toyota February US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Feb 1-28, 1997     Feb 1-29, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    44,863	    35,430	    +31.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   9,485	    10,051	     -1.7</p>
<p> Import Car		16,040	    15,923	     +4.9</p>
<p> Import Truck	    15,619	    15,081	     +7.9</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Feb 28, 1997 Jan 1-Feb 29, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    99,506	    64,195	    +58.1</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  20,642	    18,858	    +11.6</p>
<p> Import Car		36,253	    35,371	     +4.5</p>
<p> Import Truck	    36,254	    26,648	    +38.8</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 24 in latest month vs 25, 50 for year to date vs 51 in year ago.</p>
</text>
